WEBVTT

1
00:00:29,330 --> 00:00:31,450
I came early this time and have already logged in eight times.

2
00:00:31,450 --> 00:00:33,170
More than 400 kilograms of large prawns were caught

3
00:00:33,170 --> 00:00:35,250
I should be able to earn several hundred yuan more than yesterday.

4
00:00:35,650 --> 00:00:37,250
But compared to the gap of 7,000 yuan

5
00:00:37,490 --> 00:00:38,810
Still struggling to make ends meet

6
00:00:39,050 --> 00:00:40,530
There is no way to catch the shrimp anymore

7
00:00:40,810 --> 00:00:42,370
You have to find a solution elsewhere

8
00:00:42,870 --> 00:00:44,510
More loss means more burden

9
00:00:45,030 --> 00:00:46,510
Youdao is that the legs are also meat.

10
00:00:46,910 --> 00:00:48,310
Even if I can only get some oysters

11
00:00:48,310 --> 00:01:07,260
But as for the food, it’s better than ordering something like this from a bare-handed wall.

12
00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:12,660
Might as well go back to the boat and cast a chicken net

13
00:01:13,160 --> 00:01:14,200
Isn’t it chicken feet?

14
00:01:14,600 --> 00:01:16,240
Since when did we have this thing here?
